# BuildKit honours "<dockerfile>.dockerignore" in preference to the context root
# .dockerignore, which lets this image keep its ignore rules self-contained
# (nothing outside docker/online-eval/ is added to the repo).
#
# The build context is the repo root (~9 GB). Only PyRep/, RLBench/ and
# docker/online-eval/ are actually COPYed, so exclude everything else.
*

!PyRep
!RLBench
!docker/online-eval

# Fork git history is ~730 MB and irrelevant to the install.
**/.git
**/.github
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
PyRep/docs
PyRep/tests
PyRep/tutorials
RLBench/tests
RLBench/tutorials
RLBench/readme_files
RLBench/docs
# A previously-extracted CoppeliaSim under PyRep/ would bloat the context; the
# image downloads its own copy to /opt.
PyRep/CoppeliaSim_Edu_V4_1_0_Ubuntu20_04
